    "name": "Handmade Birch Wood Coasters –Set of 2",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Elevate your home decor with our sustainable birch wood coasters. These coasters blend rustic charm with modern durability, keeping your furniture protected while looking stylish.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Superior Protection: Each piece is treated with multiple coats of poly for water resistance and better durability. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Handmade Quality: Crafted from premium birch, sanded for a smooth finish, and designed for long-lasting use.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Details: 4.5-5.5(2-pack has matching diameters. Though keep in mind these are not perfect birch rounds) diameter, perfect for mugs, wine glasses, and tumblers.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Eco-Friendly: A natural, sustainable alternative to synthetic coasters.</span></p>",
